{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>If he will redeem you, good.</b> Some say that Tov was the name of the redeemers. But if so, why did Scripture say in the scroll, 'Turn aside, sit here, So-and-so'? Rather, its meaning is: if the redeemer redeems you, it is good for you that he redeem, for he is an important man."], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:30.623749424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}